    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::298605654",
      "Source": "Tastes salty and metallic, yet still strangely fulfilling to hungry creatures...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"尝起来咸咸的，带有金属味，但对饥饿的生物来说，却依然莫名地满足...","JA":""},
