      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4258235052",
      "Source": "Combine various Apex Drops to create this device to summon the Bloodstarved Sanguivern Boss for a brutal challenge & huge rewards upon it's defeat.<#RN#><#RN#>WARNING: This Boss is meant to be twice as hard as Alpha Bloodstarved Sanguivern. Do not underestimate it. Only Summon if absolutely prepared.<#RN#><#RN#>Note: Crafting costs will change if you have the Arkology: New Encounters Variant Mod installed or not. (Change does not show in engram list)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"结合各种顶级掉落物来制造此装置，以召唤嗜血血灵龙蝠首领，迎接残酷挑战，并在击败它后获得丰厚奖励。<#RN#><#RN#>警告：此首领的难度预计是困难嗜血血灵龙蝠的两倍。切勿低估它。只有在完全准备好的情况下才进行召唤。<#RN#><#RN#>注意：制作成本会根据你是否安装了方舟学：新遭遇变体模组而改变。（此变化不会在印痕技能列表中显示）","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1036889540",
      "Source": "Purified Sanguine Elixir",
      "Trans": {"SC":"净化的血之灵药","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::215546446",
      "Source": "Tastes salty and metallic, yet still strangely satisfying to hungry creatures...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"尝起来咸咸的，带有金属味，但对饥饿的生物来说，却依然莫名地令人满足...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3346842241",
      "Source": "Bloodstarved Sanguivern Costume",
      "Trans": {"SC":"嗜血血灵龙蝠套装","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::401024458",
      "Source": "This costume can be used to make your Sanguivern look like the Bloodstarved Sanguivern Boss",
      "Trans": {"SC":"此服装可用于让你的血灵龙蝠看起来像嗜血血灵龙蝠首领","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
