    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3182284072",
      "Source": "Implant of the Bloodstarved Sanguivern",
      "Trans": {"SC":"嗜血血灵龙蝠植入体","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1141392558",
      "Source": "A mysterious implant found in the heart of the Bloodstarved Sanguivern. <#RN#><#RN#>It still hums of energy & sounds of a heart beat. I wonder if it still has a use...<#RN#><#RN#>-------!! ----- --------- -- ------------ ------ --- -------- ---- ---- vctaitea ---------- ----: --------------!!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在嗜血血灵龙蝠心脏中发现的神秘植入物。<#RN#><#RN#>它仍在嗡嗡作响，充满能量，并有心跳声。我想知道它是否还有用...<#RN#><#RN#>-------!! ----- --------- -- ------------ ------ --- -------- ---- ---- vctaitea ---------- ----: --------------!!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
