    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3476053753",
      "Source": "Combine various Apex Drops to create this device to summon the Bloodstarved Sanguivern Boss for a brutal challenge & huge rewards upon it's defeat.<#RN#><#RN#>WARNING: This Boss is meant to be very difficult. Do not underestimate it. Only Summon if absolutely prepared.<#RN#><#RN#>Note: Crafting costs will change if you have the Arkology: New Encounters Variant Mod installed or not. (Change does not show in engram list)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"结合各种顶级掉落物来制造此装置，以召唤嗜血血灵龙蝠首领，迎接残酷挑战，并在击败它后获得丰厚奖励。<#RN#><#RN#>警告：此首领难度极高。切勿低估它。只有在完全准备好的情况下才进行召唤。<#RN#><#RN#>注意：制作成本会根据你是否安装了方舟学：新遭遇变体模组而改变。（此变化不会在印痕技能列表中显示）","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
