    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2654663014",
      "Source": "Combine various Apex Drops to create this device to summon the Bloodstarved Sanguivern Boss for a brutal challenge & huge rewards upon it's defeat.<#RN#><#RN#>WARNING: This Boss is meant to be twice as hard as Alpha Bloodstarved Sanguivern. Do not underestimate it. Only Summon if absolutely prepared.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"结合各类顶级掉落物制作该装置，用以召唤嗜血血灵龙蝠首领，直面残酷挑战，击败它即可获取丰厚奖励。<#RN#><#RN#>警告：该首领的难度为困难嗜血血灵龙蝠的两倍，切勿轻视。请在做好万全准备后再进行召唤。","JA":""},
